# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Cloudflare Workers static assets ignore rules
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Wrangler reads this file from the root of `assets.directory` (the repo root,
# see wrangler.jsonc) and skips every path that matches it, using .gitignore
# syntax. Ignored paths are never uploaded, so they are never public.
#
# The pattern below is an allow-list: "*" excludes everything and the "!"
# lines re-include only the three files that make up the static wallet.
#
# This is what fixes the build error:
#   ✘ [ERROR] Asset too large. ... node_modules/workerd/bin/workerd (127 MiB)
# Wrangler supports at most 25 MiB per asset / 100,000 assets, and it does NOT
# skip node_modules by default - so the whole repo must be excluded here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Exclude everything ...
*
# ... except the browser files that are actually served.
!/index.html
!/app.js
!/styles.css
